13. [... {d}]utu# [...] szesz#?-ra ki ag2 {d}lamma {gesz}tukul-ga2-kam 
#tr.en: The youth Utu who makes a brother love a brother(?) is the protective spirit of my weapon 
14. [...]-mu#-un-kal-la#-ge# la ga14-mu-un-ne3#?-e 
